OL,3,GNorthern Ireland
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FA dry and bright day with
OL,6,Fvariable cloud and some hazy sunny
OL,7,Fspells. WInds will remain light and it
OL,8,Fwill become warm or very warm.
OL,9,
OL,10,CTonight:FA dry bright evening. The
OL,11,Fsouth and east will stay dry overnight
OL,12,Fwith some clear intervals, while cloud
OL,13,Fand showery rain reaches northwestern
OL,14,Fcounties.
OL,15,
OL,16,CWednesday:FA mainly dry and bright day
OL,17,Fwith some sunshine and just the odd
OL,18,Fshower. A very warm to hot day.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
