OL,3,GNorthern Ireland
OL,4,
OL,5,COutlook for Thursday to Saturday:
OL,6,FAnother hot and mainly dry day on
OL,7,FThursday with some sunshine, some
OL,8,Fshowers later. Cooler and cloudier on
OL,9,FFriday and Saturday, sunny intervals
OL,10,Fand a few showers.
